'''Swirly Gun''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
It resembles a mini revolver with a Christmas appearance to it. Its barrel is silver with a large golden muzzle and two golden straps around it. The handle is also silver with red stripes over it, resembling a candy cane. The trigger is golden with a swirly peppermint attached to it that has a connecting silver blade on it below the barrel. The hammer and magazine plate are golden. 

== Trivia ==
*It was a victim of mass duping causing it to lose a lot of its value.
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], which was found in the same box.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*For some time, it was worth more than its [[Chroma Swirly Gun|chroma counterpart]].
*It is part of a set with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Swirly Axe]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Swirly_Set Swirly Set].
*It is also part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Swirly_Set Full Swirly Set] with [[Swirly Axe]] and [[Swirly Blade]].
*There are [[Blue Swirly Gun|blue]], [[Bronze Swirly Gun|bronze]], [[Silver Swirly Gun|silver]], and [[Gold Swirly Gun|gold]] reskin variants of this gun, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies.

